">质量效应混搭包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mass-effect-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/iWaY0S0z/60dc005c96d9bc5c95807c711a36e5fb2e414f24.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"蒸汽朋克材质包图标\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/steampunk-texture-pack\">蒸汽朋克材质包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/steampunk-texture-pack?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1Ee44YG5/d511ee3a7d36c90b76a84a640bf9586995da0f44.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"埃及神话混搭包图标\" /></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/egyptian-mythology-mash-up\">埃及神话混搭包</a></strong></td><td><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/egyptian-mythology-mash-up?logo=Modrinth&label=Downloads\" /></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n![推荐基岩版实体模型](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2049db112bd3b57aea34f9ea2f04e565a87110dc.png)\n\n本资源包使用了基岩版实体模型（Bedrock Entity Models）。如果没有它，自定义实体模型将无法显示。为了获得最佳体验，建议使用[基岩版实体模型](https://modrinth.com/mod/bedrock-entity-models)。\n\n---\n\n本资源包是《主机遗产版》中“北欧神话混搭包”的移植版本，并采用了来自《基岩版》的更新纹理。原始纹理由 4J Studios 制作。\n</center>",
